# Issue #2903 (P7, greenfield flag day): a link or unlink whose blob rewraps
# do not name exactly the active bindings now returns the
# `document_link_attachments_changed` code, a new member of
# DocumentMutationErrorCode shared by every document and container mutation
# 409. Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main contains the new
# contract.
